{
  "name": "664. cc15 TXE-8179 databricks-claude-per-block-cache-control: Databricks Claude receives the caller's cache_control breakpoints",
  "description": "TXE-8179. Databricks documents per-block cache_control for its Claude endpoints only (\"This parameter is only accepted by Databricks-hosted Claude models\", docs.databricks.com/aws/en/machine-learning/foundation-model-apis/api-reference), on content blocks, tool calls and tool definitions, and documents no ttl. The OpenAI-shape chat encoder stripped every marker for every provider but OpenRouter, so Databricks Claude never cached. perBlockCacheControlRules (core/providers/openai) now decides per provider. 664.1 sends a Claude endpoint a request with a marker on a content block and on a tool: both must reach the fixture's /serving-endpoints/chat/completions. 664.2 sends the same body to a Gemini endpoint: no marker may reach it. 664.3 asks Databricks Claude for a 1-hour marker: the gateway refuses it with 400 caller_unsupported_parameter on cache_control.ttl and sends nothing upstream, because dropping the ttl would write a 5-minute cache the caller did not ask for (contract C4). 664.4 to 664.7 do the same through the converted routes, /v1/responses and /anthropic/v1/messages: Databricks declines native Responses for a Claude endpoint, the gateway emulates through chat, and the markers must survive the conversion, or the ttl be refused before any call.",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "664.1 a Databricks Claude endpoint receives the cache_control on a content block and on a tool (fixture) - databricks/databricks-claude-cache-fixture",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixture') !== '1') {",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}",
              "pm.sendRequest({ url: pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixtureUrl') + '/__reset', method: 'POST' }, function (err, res) {",
              "  pm.test('setup: the fixture was reset', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(err, String(err)).to.equal(null);",
              "    pm.expect(res.code).to.equal(200);",
              "  });",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// wire: the Databricks chat bodies that reached the fixture since the reset.",
              "function wire(cb) {",
              "  pm.sendRequest({ url: pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixtureUrl') + '/__wire', method: 'GET' }, function (err, res) {",
              "    pm.test('the fixture answered /__wire', function () { pm.expect(err, String(err)).to.equal(null); });",
              "    cb((res.json().data[0].calls || []).filter(function (c) { return c.path === '/serving-endpoints/chat/completions'; }));",
              "  });",
              "}",
              "pm.test('the chat completion succeeds', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code, 'failed: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql(200);",
              "});",
              "wire(function (calls) {",
              "  pm.test('one request reached Databricks', function () { pm.expect(calls.length, JSON.stringify(calls)).to.eql(1); });",
              "  if (calls.length !== 1) { return; }",
              "  var sent = JSON.parse(calls[0].body);",
              "  pm.test('the content block keeps its cache_control', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(sent.messages[0].content[0].cache_control, calls[0].body).to.eql({ type: 'ephemeral' });",
              "  });",
              "  pm.test('the tool keeps its cache_control', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(sent.tools[0].cache_control, calls[0].body).to.eql({ type: 'ephemeral' });",
              "  });",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"model\":\"databricks/databricks-claude-cache-fixture\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"a long shared prefix worth caching\",\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}}]}],\"tools\":[{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"lookup\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{}}},\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}}]}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "chat",
            "completions"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
